# .templatesyncignore
#
# Paths listed here are NOT overwritten by the template sync
# (AndreasAugustin/actions-template-sync). After the upstream pull, each line is
# passed to `git reset` to restore this repository's local version, so the sync
# never pushes changes to these files.
#
# Each line is a git pathspec; one per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Files NOT listed here (e.g. disk_config/, Justfile, system_files/) are still
# kept in sync with ublue-os/image-template.
#
# Remove a line when you want the upstream template to manage that file again.

# --- image identity / build configuration ------------------------------------
# Base image, IMAGE_NAME and REPO_ORGANIZATION live here. Syncing upstream would
# reset these to the template defaults (IMAGE_NAME=image-template,
# REPO_ORGANIZATION=alice-and-bob), which would publish the wrong image.
image-template.env

# --- container definition ----------------------------------------------------
# Custom base image (ghcr.io/ublue-os/aurora-dx:stable) and local tweaks.
Containerfile

# --- packages / system tweaks ------------------------------------------------
# Local package list and enabled units (cockpit, keepalived, openbao, ...).
build_files/build.sh

# --- project docs ------------------------------------------------------------
# Custom README documenting this repo's fork/worktree update process.
README.md

# --- optional: uncomment if you start diverging on these ---------------------
# The CI workflows are currently still synced from upstream. Uncomment the two
# lines below to stop the sync from touching them (also removes the need for the
# PAT to carry the `workflow` scope).
# .github/workflows/build.yml
# .github/workflows/build-disk.yml
